sequenceDiagram
  autonumber
  actor U as User
  participant C as React client
  participant A as Express API
  participant D as PostgreSQL
  U->>C: Delete order, confirm
  C->>A: DELETE /api/purchase-orders/:id or /api/sales-orders/:id
  A->>D: BEGIN
  A->>D: Find order in this account and its lines
  alt Purchase order
    loop Each line
      A->>D: UPDATE stock − qty WHERE stock ≥ qty
    end
    alt Any line short
      A->>D: ROLLBACK
      A-->>C: 409 stock already sold
    end
  else Sales order
    loop Each line
      A->>D: UPDATE stock + qty
    end
  end
  A->>D: DELETE its ledger entries and the order
  A->>D: COMMIT
  A->>D: Activity log
  A-->>C: 204 deleted
  C-->>U: Order removed, stock restored
